<title>POLAND: PROCHNIK TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 11.</title>
<headline>PROCHNIK TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 11.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 149,999 shares in Polish garment maker Prochnik SA at 11 zlotys each was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Tuesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session Prochnik traded at 9.25 zlotys in a volume of 18,384 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
